#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:130
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of BIND"
msgstr "Instalação do BIND"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Starting with bind-9.18.20, the IP addresses for B.ROOT-SERVERS.NET have "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Começando com bind-9.18.20, os endereços de IP para B.ROOT-SERVERS.NET "
"mudaram."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:150
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>BIND</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>BIND</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:154
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc       \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var    \\\n"
"            --mandir=/usr/share/man \\\n"
"            --disable-static        &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc       \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var    \\\n"
"            --mandir=/usr/share/man \\\n"
"            --disable-static        &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Issue the following commands to run the complete suite of tests.  First, as "
"the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, set up some test "
"interfaces:"
msgstr ""
"Emita os seguintes comandos para executar a suíte completa de teste. "
"Primeiro, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;, configure algumas interfaces de "
"teste:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:169
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If IPv6 is not enabled in the kernel, there will be several error messages: "
"\"RTNETLINK answers: Operation not permitted\".  These messages do not "
"affect the tests."
msgstr ""
"Se o &quot;IPv6&quot; não estiver habilitado no núcleo, [então] existirão "
"diversas mensagens de erro: &quot;RTNETLINK answers: Operation not "
"permitted&quot;. Essas mensagens não afetam os testes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:176
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>bin/tests/system/ifconfig.sh up</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>bin/tests/system/ifconfig.sh up</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:179
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The test suite may indicate some skipped tests depending on what "
"configuration options are used. Some tests are marked "
"<quote>UNTESTED</quote> or do even fail if <xref linkend=\"perl-net-dns\"/> "
"is not installed. Two tests, <filename>resolver</filename> and "
"<filename>dispatch</filename>, are known to fail.  To run the tests, as an "
"unprivileged user, execute:"
msgstr ""
"A suíte de teste possivelmente indique alguns testes ignorados dependendo de"
" quais opções de configuração são usadas. Alguns testes são marcados como "
"<quote>UNTESTED</quote> ou até falham se o <xref linkend=\"perl-net-dns\"/> "
"não estiver instalado. Dois testes, <filename>resolver</filename> e "
"<filename>dispatch</filename>, são conhecidos por falharem. Para executar os"
" testes, como um(a) usuário(a) sem privilégios, execute:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:187
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make -k check</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make -k check</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:190
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Again as <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, clean up the test"
" interfaces:"
msgstr ""
"Novamente como &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;,"
" limpe as interfaces de teste:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:195
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>bin/tests/system/ifconfig.sh down</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>bin/tests/system/ifconfig.sh down</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:198
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Finally, install the package as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, instale o pacote como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#.  Documentation is an issue - The docs are now all in .rst format and appear
#. to be sphinx based. install source .rst files for now...
#. leave docs untouched as they does only use disk space when not
#. used to recreate the docs via Sphinx. I've added a note regarding
#. the documentation. (thomas)
#. <screen role="root"><userinput>make install &amp;&amp;
#. install -vdm 755 /usr/share/doc/bind-&bind-version;/{arm,dnssec-guide}
#. &amp;&amp;
#. install doc/arm/* /usr/share/doc/bind-&bind-version;/arm
#. &amp;&amp;
#. install doc/dnssec-guide/* /usr/share/doc/bind-&bind-version;/dnssec-
#. guide</userinput></screen>
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:215
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:220
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:223
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--sysconfdir=/etc</parameter>: This parameter forces "
"<application>BIND</application> to look for configuration files in <filename"
" class='directory'>/etc</filename> instead of <filename "
"class='directory'>/usr/etc</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--sysconfdir=/etc</parameter>: Esse parâmetro força o "
"&quot;<application>BIND</application>&quot; a procurar arquivos de "
"configuração em &quot;<filename class='directory'>/etc</filename>&quot; em "
"vez de &quot;<filename class='directory'>/usr/etc</filename>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:238
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-libidn2</option>: This parameter enables the IDNA2008 "
"(Internationalized Domain Names in Applications)  support."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-libidn2</option>: Esse parâmetro habilita o suporte a "
"&quot;Internationalized Domain Names in Applications&quot; "
"(&quot;IDNA2008&quot;)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:244
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-fetchlimit</option>: Use this option if you want to be able"
" to limit the rate of recursive client queries. This may be useful on "
"servers which receive a large number of queries."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-fetchlimit</option>: Use essa opção se você quiser estar "
"apto(a) a limitar a taxa de consultas recursivas do cliente. Isso "
"possivelmente seja útil em servidores que recebem um grande número de "
"consultas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:250
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-linux-caps</option>: BIND can also be built without "
"capability support by using this option, at the cost of some loss of "
"security."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-linux-caps</option>: O &quot;BIND&quot; também pode ser "
"construído sem suporte de capacidade usando-se essa opção, ao custo de "
"alguma perda de segurança."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:256
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-dlz-{mysql,bdb,filesystem,ldap,odbc,stub}</option>: Use one "
"(or more) of those options to add Dynamically Loadable Zones support.  For "
"more information refer to <ulink url=\"https://bind-"
"dlz.sourceforge.net/\">bind-dlz.sourceforge.net</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-dlz-{mysql,bdb,filesystem,ldap,odbc,stub}</option>: Use uma "
"(ou mais) dessas opções para adicionar suporte a Zonas Dinamicamente "
"Carregáveis. Para mais informações, consulte-se <ulink url=\"https://bind-"
"dlz.sourceforge.net/\">bind-dlz.sourceforge.net</ulink>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:263
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-doh</option>: Use this option if you do not have <xref "
"linkend=\"nghttp2\" role=\"nodep\"/> installed and do not need support for "
"DNS over HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-doh</option>: Use essa opção se você não tiver <xref "
"linkend=\"nghttp2\" role=\"nodep\"/> instalado e não precisar de suporte "
"para DNS sobre HTTPS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:274
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring BIND"
msgstr "Configurando o BIND"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:277
#, xml-text
msgid "Config files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:280
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<filename>named.conf</filename>, <filename>root.hints</filename>, "
"<filename>127.0.0</filename>, <filename>rndc.conf</filename>, and "
"<filename>resolv.conf</filename>"
msgstr ""
"<filename>named.conf</filename>, <filename>root.hints</filename>, "
"<filename>127.0.0</filename>, <filename>rndc.conf</filename> e "
"<filename>resolv.conf</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:288
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/named.conf"
msgstr "/etc/named.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:292
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/rndc.conf"
msgstr "/etc/rndc.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:296
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/resolv.conf"
msgstr "/etc/resolv.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:301
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/namedb/root.hints"
msgstr "/etc/namedb/root.hints"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:306
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/namedb/pz/127.0.0.0"
msgstr "/etc/namedb/pz/127.0.0.0"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:311
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:314
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>BIND</application> will be configured to run in a "
"<command>chroot</command> jail as an unprivileged user (<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">named</systemitem>). This configuration is more secure in"
" that a DNS compromise can only affect a few files in the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">named</systemitem> user's <envar>HOME</envar> directory."
msgstr ""
"O <application>BIND</application> será configurado para executar em uma "
"jaula <command>chroot</command> como um(a) usuário(a) sem privilégios "
"(<systemitem class=\"username\">named</systemitem>). Essa configuração é "
"mais segura naquilo que um comprometimento do DNS consegue afetar somente "
"uns poucos arquivos no diretório <envar>HOME</envar> do(a) usuário(a) "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">named</systemitem>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:323
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Create the unprivileged user and group <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">named</systemitem>:"
msgstr ""
"Crie o(a) usuário(a) sem privilégios e grupo &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">named</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:327
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 20 named &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c \"BIND Owner\" -g named -s /bin/false -u 20 named &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -d -m770 -o named -g named /srv/named</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 20 named &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c \"Proprietário(a) do BIND\" -g named -s /bin/false -u 20 named &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -d -m770 -o named -g named /srv/named</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:332
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Set up some files, directories and devices needed by "
"<application>BIND</application>:"
msgstr ""
"Configure alguns arquivos, diretórios e dispositivos necessários ao "
"&quot;<application>BIND</application>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:336
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -p /srv/named &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd       /srv/named &amp;&amp;\n"
"mkdir -p dev etc/named/{slave,pz} usr/lib/engines var/run/named &amp;&amp;\n"
"mknod /srv/named/dev/null c 1 3 &amp;&amp;\n"
"mknod /srv/named/dev/urandom c 1 9 &amp;&amp;\n"
"chmod 666 /srv/named/dev/{null,urandom} &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp /etc/localtime etc</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -p /srv/named &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd      /srv/named &amp;&amp;\n"
"mkdir -p dev etc/named/{slave,pz} usr/lib/engines var/run/named &amp;&amp;\n"
"mknod /srv/named/dev/null c 1 3 &amp;&amp;\n"
"mknod /srv/named/dev/urandom c 1 9 &amp;&amp;\n"
"chmod 666 /srv/named/dev/{null,urandom} &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp /etc/localtime etc</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:345
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <filename>rndc.conf</filename> file contains information for controlling"
" <command>named</command> operations with the <command>rndc</command> "
"utility. Generate a key for use in the <filename>named.conf</filename> and "
"<filename>rndc.conf</filename> with the <command>rndc-confgen</command> "
"command:"
msgstr ""
"O arquivo &quot;<filename>rndc.conf</filename>&quot; contém informações para"
" controlar as operações do &quot;<command>named</command>&quot; com o "
"utilitário &quot;<command>rndc</command>&quot;. Gere uma chave para uso no "
"&quot;<filename>named.conf</filename>&quot; e "
"&quot;<filename>rndc.conf</filename>&quot; com o comando "
"&quot;<command>rndc-confgen</command>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:352
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>rndc-confgen -a -b 512 -t /srv/named</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>rndc-confgen -a -b 512 -t /srv/named</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:355
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Create the <filename>named.conf</filename> file from which "
"<command>named</command> will read the location of zone files, root name "
"servers and secure DNS keys:"
msgstr ""
"Crie o arquivo <filename>named.conf</filename> a partir do qual o "
"<command>named</command> lerá o local dos arquivos de zona, servidores raiz "
"de nomes e chaves seguras DNS:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:360
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<?dbfo keep-together=\"auto\"?><userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /srv/named/etc/named.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>options {\n"
"    directory \"/etc/named\";\n"
"    pid-file \"/var/run/named.pid\";\n"
"    statistics-file \"/var/run/named.stats\";\n"
"\n"
"};\n"
"zone \".\" {\n"
"    type hint;\n"
"    file \"root.hints\";\n"
"};\n"
"zone \"0.0.127.in-addr.arpa\" {\n"
"    type master;\n"
"    file \"pz/127.0.0\";\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"// Bind 9 now logs by default through syslog (except debug).\n"
"// These are the default logging rules.\n"
"\n"
"logging {\n"
"    category default { default_syslog; default_debug; };\n"
"    category unmatched { null; };\n"
"\n"
"  channel default_syslog {\n"
"      syslog daemon;                      // send to syslog's daemon\n"
"                                          // facility\n"
"      severity info;                      // only send priority info\n"
"                                          // and higher\n"
"  };\n"
"\n"
"  channel default_debug {\n"
"      file \"named.run\";                   // write to named.run in\n"
"                                          // the working directory\n"
"                                          // Note: stderr is used instead\n"
"                                          // of \"named.run\"\n"
"                                          // if the server is started\n"
"                                          // with the '-f' option.\n"
"      severity dynamic;                   // log at the server's\n"
"                                          // current debug level\n"
"  };\n"
"\n"
"  channel default_stderr {\n"
"      stderr;                             // writes to stderr\n"
"      severity info;                      // only send priority info\n"
"                                          // and higher\n"
"  };\n"
"\n"
"  channel null {\n"
"      null;                               // toss anything sent to\n"
"                                          // this channel\n"
"  };\n"
"};</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<?dbfo keep-together=\"auto\"?><userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /srv/named/etc/named.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>options {\n"
"    directory \"/etc/named\";\n"
"    pid-file \"/var/run/named.pid\";\n"
"    statistics-file \"/var/run/named.stats\";\n"
"\n"
"};\n"
"zone \".\" {\n"
"    type hint;\n"
"    file \"root.hints\";\n"
"};\n"
"zone \"0.0.127.in-addr.arpa\" {\n"
"    type master;\n"
"    file \"pz/127.0.0\";\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"// O \"Bind\" 9 agora registra por padrão por intermédio do \"syslog\" (exceto depuração).\n"
"// Estas são as regras padrão de registro.\n"
"\n"
"logging {\n"
"    category default { default_syslog; default_debug; };\n"
"    category unmatched { null; };\n"
"\n"
"  channel default_syslog {\n"
"      syslog daemon;                      // Envia para o recurso de processo de segundo plano\n"
"                                          // do \"syslog\"\n"
"      severity info;                      // Envia somente informações prioritárias\n"
"                                          // e superiores\n"
"  };\n"
"\n"
"  channel default_debug {\n"
"      file \"named.run\";                   // Escreve para \"named.run\" no \n"
"                                          // diretório de trabalho. \n"
"                                          // Observação: \"stderr\" é \n"
"                                          // usado em vez de \"named.run\" \n"
"                                          // se o servidor for iniciado \n"
"                                          // com a opção \"-f\".\n"
"      severity dynamic;                   // Registra no nível de \n"
"                                          // depuração atual do servidor.\n"
"  };\n"
"\n"
"  channel default_stderr {\n"
"      stderr;                             // Escreve para \"stderr\"\n"
"      severity info;                      // Envia somente informações prioritárias\n"
"                                          // e superiores\n"
"  };\n"
"\n"
"  channel null {\n"
"      null;                               // Descarta tudo enviado para\n"
"                                          // esse canal\n"
"  };\n"
"};</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:415
#, xml-text
msgid "Create a zone file with the following contents:"
msgstr "Crie um arquivo de zona com o seguinte conteúdo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:418
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /srv/named/etc/named/pz/127.0.0 &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>$TTL 3D\n"
"@      IN      SOA     ns.local.domain. hostmaster.local.domain. (\n"
"                        1       ; Serial\n"
"                        8H      ; Refresh\n"
"                        2H      ; Retry\n"
"                        4W      ; Expire\n"
"                        1D)     ; Minimum TTL\n"
"                NS      ns.local.domain.\n"
"1               PTR     localhost.</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /srv/named/etc/named/pz/127.0.0 &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>$TTL 3D\n"
"@     IN      SOA     ns.local.domain. hostmaster.local.domain. (\n"
"                        1       ; Serial\n"
"                        8H      ; Refresh\n"
"                        2H      ; Retry\n"
"                        4W      ; Expire\n"
"                        1D)     ; Minimum TTL\n"
"                NS      ns.local.domain.\n"
"1               PTR     localhost.</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

