#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:485
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <filename>root.hints</filename> file is a list of root name servers. "
"This file must be updated periodically with the <command>dig</command> "
"utility. A current copy of root.hints can be obtained from <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.internic.net/domain/named.root\"/>.  For details, consult "
"the \"BIND 9 Administrator Reference Manual\"."
msgstr ""
"O arquivo &quot;<filename>root.hints</filename>&quot; é uma lista de "
"servidores raiz de nomes. Esse arquivo precisa ser atualizado periodicamente"
" com o utilitário &quot;<command>dig</command>&quot;. Uma cópia atual do "
"&quot;root.hints&quot; pode ser obtida a partir de <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.internic.net/domain/named.root\"/>. Para detalhes, "
"consulte-se o &quot;Manual de Referência do(a) Administrador(a) do BIND "
"9&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:493
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Create or modify <filename>resolv.conf</filename> to use the new name server"
" with the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Crie ou modifique o &quot;<filename>resolv.conf</filename>&quot; para usar o"
" novo servidor de nomes com os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:499
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Replace <replaceable>&lt;yourdomain.com&gt;</replaceable> with your own "
"valid domain name."
msgstr ""
"Substitua <replaceable>&lt;teudomínio.com&gt;</replaceable> pelo teu próprio"
" nome de domínio válido."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:504
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cp /etc/resolv.conf /etc/resolv.conf.bak &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/resolv.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>search <replaceable>&lt;yourdomain.com&gt;</replaceable>\n"
"nameserver 127.0.0.1</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cp /etc/resolv.conf /etc/resolv.conf.bak &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/resolv.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>search <replaceable>&lt;teudomínio.com&gt;</replaceable>\n"
"nameserver 127.0.0.1</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:511
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Set permissions on the <command>chroot</command> jail with the following "
"command:"
msgstr ""
"Configure as permissões relativas à jaula "
"&quot;<command>chroot</command>&quot; com o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:515
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>chown -R named:named /srv/named</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>chown -R named:named /srv/named</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:520
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Boot Script</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\">Systemd Unit</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Conjunto de Comandos Sequenciais de "
"Inicialização</phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\">Unidade do "
"systemd</phrase>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:524
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To start the DNS server at boot, install the <phrase "
"revision=\"sysv\"><filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/bind</filename> init "
"script</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\"><filename>named.service</filename> unit</phrase> "
"included in the <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\" revision=\"sysv\"/> <xref "
"linkend=\"systemd-units\" revision=\"systemd\"/> package:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o servidor &quot;DNS&quot; na inicialização, instale <phrase "
"revision=\"sysv\">o conjunto de comandos sequenciais de inicialização "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/bind</filename>&quot; incluso</phrase> "
"<phrase revision=\"systemd\">a unidade "
"&quot;<filename>named.service</filename>&quot; inclusa</phrase> no pacote "
"&quot;<xref linkend=\"bootscripts\" revision=\"sysv\"/>&quot; &quot;<xref "
"linkend=\"systemd-units\" revision=\"systemd\"/>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:534
#, xml-text
msgid "bind"
msgstr "bind"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:537
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-bind</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-bind</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:538
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-named</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-named</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:541
#, xml-text
msgid "Now start <application>BIND</application> with the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Agora inicie o &quot;<application>BIND</application>&quot; com o seguinte "
"comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:544
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>/etc/rc.d/init.d/bind start</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>/etc/rc.d/init.d/bind start</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:545
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>systemctl start named</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>systemctl start named</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:550
#, xml-text
msgid "Testing BIND"
msgstr "Testando o BIND"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:553
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Test out the new <application>BIND</application> 9 installation.  First "
"query the local host address with <command>dig</command>:"
msgstr ""
"Teste a nova instalação do &quot;<application>BIND</application>&quot; 9. "
"Primeiro consulte o endereço local do dispositivo com o "
"&quot;<command>dig</command>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:557
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>dig -x 127.0.0.1</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>dig -x 127.0.0.1</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:560
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now try an external name lookup, taking note of the speed difference in "
"repeated lookups due to the caching. Run the <command>dig</command> command "
"twice on the same address:"
msgstr ""
"Agora tente uma pesquisa externa de nome, observando a diferença de "
"velocidade em pesquisas repetidas devido ao cache. Execute o comando "
"&quot;<command>dig</command>&quot; duas vezes relativo ao mesmo endereço:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:565
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>dig www.&lfs-domainname; &amp;&amp;\n"
"dig www.&lfs-domainname;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>dig www.&lfs-domainname; &amp;&amp;\n"
"dig www.&lfs-domainname;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:569
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You can see almost instantaneous results with the named caching lookups. "
"Consult the <application>BIND</application> Administrator Reference Manual "
"(see below) for further configuration options."
msgstr ""
"Você pode ver resultados quase instantâneos com as pesquisas de cache do "
"&quot;named&quot;. Consulte-se o Manual de Referência do(a) Administrador(a)"
" do &quot;<application>BIND</application>&quot; (veja-se abaixo) para mais "
"opções de configuração."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:579
#, xml-text
msgid "Administrator Reference Manual (ARM)"
msgstr "Manual de Referência do(a) Administrador(a) (MRA)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:582
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The ARM documentation (do not confuse with the processor architecture)  is "
"included in the source package. The documentation is in .rst format which "
"means that it can be converted in human readable formats if <xref "
"linkend=\"sphinx\"/> is installed."
msgstr ""
"A documentação ARM (não confunda com a arquitetura do processador) está "
"incluída no pacote do fonte. A documentação está no formato .rst, o que "
"significa que ela pode ser convertida em formatos legíveis por humanos se o "
"<xref linkend=\"sphinx\"/> estiver instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/bind.xml:589
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"When <application>BIND</application> is set up, especially if it is going to"
" be operating in a real live scenario, it is <emphasis>highly</emphasis> "
"recommended to consult the ARM documentation. ISC provides an updated set of"
" excellent documentation along with every release so it can be easily viewed"
" and/or downloaded &ndash; so there is no excuse to not read the docs. The "
"formats ISC provides are PDF, epub and html at <ulink "
"url=\"https://downloads.isc.org/isc/bind9/&bind-version;/doc/arm/\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Quando o <application>BIND</application> estiver configurado, especialmente "
"se ele for operar em um cenário da vida real, é "
"<emphasis>altamente</emphasis> recomendado consultar a documentação ARM. O "
"ISC fornece um conjunto atualizado de excelente documentação junto com cada "
"lançamento, de forma que possa ser facilmente visualizada e (ou) baixada "
"&ndash; então, não existe desculpa para não ler os documentos. Os formatos "
"que o ISC fornece são PDF, epub e HTML em <ulink "
"url=\"https://downloads.isc.org/isc/bind9/&bind-version;/doc/arm/\"/>."

